{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:03.22] Uh, when I wake up (Uh)\n[00:04.96] Look over to her, she doing her makeup\n[00:07.86] I'm her blessing and her curse\n[00:10.08] I've been through this a thousand times\n[00:13.94] I've been through this a thousand\n[00:16.58] I wake up (Uh), still could see the Perc' in my eyes\n[00:20.02] Fucked up, I know Satan's here, but he's in disguise\n[00:23.74] I've been through this a thousand times\n[00:27.00] I've been through this a thousand\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:29.12] I see her face everyday, sometimes, I'm lost in her maze\n[00:32.04] Sometimes, I'm lost in her space, sometimes, I don't know what to say\n[00:35.74] Plus, the drugs that she takes so happen to be my favorite\n[00:38.72] The Percocets make me late, everyday, happy belated\n[00:42.14] I was younger than young when I wanted drug love\n[00:45.32] Now, it's not what I want, I care too much about her\n[00:49.06] But I can't front, I still pop, sip, roll my blunts\n[00:52.26] Three drugs at once, wondering if I'll make the rising sun\n[Pre-Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:56.48] I'm worried about you\n[00:58.56] You ask me if I'm high, I say, \"Yeah, I took about two\"\n[01:02.00] Uh, plus two, bet I'd still fuck you\n[01:04.74] Praying to make it to the morning by the end of the night\n[Chorus: Miley Cyrus & Juice WRLD]\n[01:09.04] When I wake up (Uh)\n[01:10.28] Look over at him, he's still so fucked up\n[01:13.60] I'm always afraid what I'll find\n[01:15.52] I've been through this a thousand times\n[01:18.92] I've been through this a thousand\n[01:21.94] I give up (Uh), I just wanna get out alive\n[01:24.70] It's fucked up, at least I can say that I tried\n[01:26.86] I've been through this a thousand times\n[01:28.34] I've been through this a thousand\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD & Miley Cyrus]\n[01:35.56] Did I say thousand? I meant million (Million)\n[01:39.00] Shorty tryna have my kids, gettin' her Billie Jean on\n[01:42.04] But I just want the brain like Jimmy Neutro